      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Continental Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I see.",
      "translation" : "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Continental Guard",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll send you to the field shortly.",
      "translation" : "我马上送你去原野。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't believe a mummy could do this to me. Oh man, it hurts. Nobody should find out about this....",
      "translation" : "真不敢相信木乃伊竟然会这样对我。好痛啊！可不能让别人知道这件事..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mummy? What happened?",
      "translation" : "木乃伊？发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pretend not to know anything.",
      "translation" : "假装什么都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You caught me! Darn it...I didn't expect my reputation as a tomb raider would get damaged like this...",
      "translation" : "被你发现了！可恶...我没想到自己盗墓贼的名声会变成这样..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But come on, they're so strange! They're mummies! Just mummies, you know? They shouldn't be that strong!",
      "translation" : "可是你想想，它们可是木乃伊！只是木乃伊而已，怎么会那么强！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Strong mummies? Where are they?",
      "translation" : "强大的木乃伊？它们在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End the conversation.",
      "translation" : "结束对话。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Whaaat~ you don't want to hear my story? Fine! You'd better not mention my name anywhere else!",
      "translation" : "什么～你不想听我的故事？好吧！你最好别把我的名字告诉别人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha, it's a secret.",
      "translation" : "哈哈，这是秘密。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I found out while I was stealing... No, I mean, just walking through the pyramid.",
      "translation" : "我偷东西的时候发现的...不，我是说，我只是路过金字塔时发现的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When I saw a mummy coming toward me, I was like 'whatever' and didn't care. But then he knocked me down with a slap in the face! How could he do that to a cute cat like me! You bandaged freak... you just wait and see!",
      "translation" : "我看到木乃伊朝我走来时，心想“随便啦”，根本没放在心上。结果它一巴掌就把我打倒了！它怎么能这样对一只可爱的猫！你这个绷带怪...走着瞧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I would like to go, too.",
      "translation" : "我也想去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End the conversation.",
      "translation" : "结束对话。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No way! I spent so much time finding that path!!",
      "translation" : "才不行！我花了那么多时间才找到那条路！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... but if you insist, just give me 5000 Zeny. I'll lead you.",
      "translation" : "嗯...不过你要是坚持，就给我5000 Zeny，我带你去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What~? Don't give me that look! Do you have any idea how hard it is for a cat to survive in Midgard!",
      "translation" : "什么～？别那样看我！你知道一只猫在米德加尔特生存有多难吗！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^FF0000But come to think of it, a weakling like you won't survive there. Maybe for a second if you're lucky?^000000",
      "translation" : "^FF0000不过话说回来，你这么弱，去了那里也活不了。运气好的话，或许还能撑一会儿？^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it's none of my business. But I warned you anyway!",
      "translation" : "算了，这不关我的事。不过我还是提醒过你了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pay 5,000 zeny and set out.",
      "translation" : "支付5000 Zeny，出发。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Forget it.",
      "translation" : "算了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Where do you think you're going! You're so broke!",
      "translation" : "你想去哪儿！你穷得叮当响！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bah, what's up with this old money... you don't have anything sparkly or shiny?!",
      "translation" : "呸，这些旧钱算什么...你没有闪闪发亮的东西吗？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ahh, just follow me!",
      "translation" : "啊，跟我来就好！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Gosh, you don't even have 5000 Zeny, do you?",
      "translation" : "天啊，你连5000 Zeny都没有吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That stupid mummy slapped me again while you were looking away! Sniff sniff... Let's go back, meow!",
      "translation" : "我刚才没注意的时候，那只笨木乃伊又打了我一巴掌！呜呜...我们回去吧，喵！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go back to Thief Guild",
      "translation" : "返回盗贼公会"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eliminate Verit",
      "translation" : "消灭维瑞特"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eliminate Ancient Mummy",
      "translation" : "消灭古代木乃伊"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's nothing",
      "translation" : "没什么"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Right right... let's go back.",
      "translation" : "好吧好吧...我们回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at that Verit, he's afraid of us! Kyaahaha! We're safe, at least for a while!",
      "translation" : "看那只维瑞特，它怕我们呢！呀哈哈哈！至少暂时安全了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Did you know that cats and dogs don't get along?",
      "translation" : "你知道猫和狗不合吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at that ugly and hideous Verit. He's scowling, wagging his tail and trying to come closer.",
      "translation" : "看那只又丑又吓人的维瑞特。它皱着眉、摇着尾巴，还想靠近我们。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, you don't have a tail, right? He thinks I'm a thorn in his side, and he's trying to start a fight now!",
      "translation" : "哦，你没有尾巴吧？它觉得我碍眼，现在还想找我打架！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look at him, so greedy and drooly... I don't like the way he breathes, either. I can't stand how he's making those gobbling sounds...",
      "translation" : "看它那副贪婪又流口水的样子...我也不喜欢它呼吸的样子，受不了它吧唧吧唧地嚼东西..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's so obvious that he's waiting to attack me from behind.",
      "translation" : "它肯定在等机会从背后偷袭我，这也太明显了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Gosh, I could have scratched his face so hard if it wasn't for my stomachache!",
      "translation" : "要不是我肚子疼，我早就把它的脸抓花了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey, it's not because I'm afraid of Majoruros!",
      "translation" : "喂，我才不是怕米诺陶！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to go home, you'd better beat up that ugly doggie! Otherwise, he'll bite you!",
      "translation" : "想回家的话，就把那只丑狗打倒！不然它会咬你的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Help him",
      "translation" : "帮帮它"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stay away",
      "translation" : "离远点"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good, the target number is 20! Good luck!",
      "translation" : "好，目标数量是20只！祝你好运！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pah! You don't care about me? Fine, you traitor!",
      "translation" : "呸，你一点都不关心我？好吧，你这个叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Is Verit's training going well?",
      "translation" : "维瑞特训练得怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure.",
      "translation" : "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to stop.",
      "translation" : "我想停下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good. Keep up the good work!",
      "translation" : "很好，继续加油！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suspicious Cat]",
      "translation" : "[可疑的猫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Suspicious Cat",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What? You're so irresponsible!",
      "translation" : "什么？你也太不负责任了！"
    },
